{"src":"de","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":207700,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"de","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":6649.286304,"text":"Doch nach dem Verlust des Tors des Kapitäns erzielte Indien nur 36 Runden und"},{"kind":"text","t":6909.791155,"text":"But after losing their captain's wicket, India scored only 36 runs."},{"kind":"audio","t":6955.108106999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":6956.654758,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6958.290721,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6959.965035,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1030},{"kind":"audio","t":6960.113297999999,"samples":5128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":10119.638101,"text":"und verlor sieben Tore, womit die Innings beendet waren."},{"kind":"text","t":10304.244218,"text":"and lost seven wickets, ending the innings."},{"kind":"audio","t":10342.702560000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":10344.127439,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10344.853154,"samples":13064,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":19506.624625,"text":"Sie haben normalerweise ein besonderes Angebot an Speisen, Getränken und Unterhaltung, um die Gäste bei Laune zu halten und dafür zu sorgen, dass sie bleiben."},{"kind":"text","t":19830.325142,"text":"They usually offer special deals on food, drinks, and entertainment to keep guests happy and ensure they stay."},{"kind":"audio","t":19878.755927000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19880.149946,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19881.796329,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19883.345701000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19884.976274,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19885.804011,"samples":22760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":28694.284126000002,"text":"Del Potro hatte im zweiten Satz einen frühen Vorteil, doch auch diesmal war ein Tie-Break erforderlich, nachdem das 6 zu 6 erreicht wurde."},{"kind":"text","t":29099.009471,"text":"Del Potro took an early lead in the second set, but again a tie-break was needed after it reached 6-6."},{"kind":"audio","t":29145.865555,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29147.639431,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29149.010509,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29150.617661,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29152.233634,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":29152.840837,"samples":17360,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":160},{"kind":"input","t":37119.962977999996,"text":"Das Internet verbindet sowohl Elemente der Massenkommunikation"},{"kind":"text","t":37252.395852999995,"text":"The Internet combines elements of mass communication"},{"kind":"audio","t":37291.346034999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":37292.897397,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":37294.234264,"samples":31064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":710},{"kind":"input","t":41900.16635,"text":"als auch der zwischenmenschlichen Kommunikation."},{"kind":"text","t":42099.252560999994,"text":"It combines elements of mass communication as well as interpersonal communication."},{"kind":"audio","t":42141.338887,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42143.009460999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42144.698816,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42146.293567999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42147.602965,"samples":29728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":610},{"kind":"input","t":51168.355635,"text":"Die Zusammensetzung dieser Kristalle entspricht der Zusammensetzung, die im Urin betroffene Haustiere gefunden wurden."},{"kind":"text","t":51434.664204999994,"text":"The composition of these crystals corresponds to the composition found in the urine of affected pets."},{"kind":"audio","t":51477.720361,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51479.254931999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51480.884585,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51482.504867999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51484.107431,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":900},{"kind":"audio","t":51484.271034,"samples":2360,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":55304.744455,"text":"wenn man sie mittels Infrarotspektrokopters bedacht."},{"kind":"text","t":55462.297120999996,"text":"when irradiating them using infrared spectroscopy."},{"kind":"audio","t":55500.316165,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55501.933617999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55503.568160999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":55503.716444,"samples":7296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":63994.078802,"text":"Auf einigen Routen setzen die größeren Firmen ihre eigenen Flugzeuge ein, aber auf anderen Routen und bei kleineren Firmen traten Schwierigkeiten auf."},{"kind":"text","t":64332.993218,"text":"On some routes, larger companies use their own aircraft, but difficulties arose on other routes with smaller companies."},{"kind":"audio","t":64378.50986399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":64380.164068,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64381.81595199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":64383.41675399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64385.08194799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64387.550338,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":64387.86266499999,"samples":11592,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":71364.37303799999,"text":"Manche Atome haben instabile Kerne, was bedeutet, dass sie schon bei geringem oder gar keinem Anstoß zerfallen."},{"kind":"text","t":71636.133298,"text":"Some atoms have unstable nuclei, which means they decay even with minimal or no stimulation."},{"kind":"audio","t":71678.884568,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":71680.47492,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":71682.10988399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71683.773147,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":71685.41514099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":71685.666466,"samples":11360,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":80029.650477,"text":"Im selben Monat schoss ein weiteres Passagierflugzeug über das Ende."},{"kind":"text","t":80188.68410299999,"text":"That same month, another passenger plane crashed."},{"kind":"audio","t":80227.067774,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":80228.667546,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80229.783209,"samples":26264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":580},{"kind":"input","t":88746.998395,"text":"einer Landebahn in Mashhad hinaus und stieß mit einer Mauer zusammen, wobei 17 Menschen ums Leben kamen."},{"kind":"text","t":89068.13666999999,"text":"It veered off a runway in Mashhad and collided with a wall, killing 17 people."},{"kind":"audio","t":89109.796938,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":89111.40047,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":89113.000043,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":89114.763339,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":89115.52142399999,"samples":19528,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":180},{"kind":"input","t":102892.54123999999,"text":"Fast alle sind Sandstrände mit sicheren Bademöglichkeiten und die meisten bieten Schatten, der von Pohutukawa-Bäumen gespendet wird."},{"kind":"text","t":103241.645874,"text":"Almost all are sandy beaches with safe swimming conditions, and most offer shade provided by pohutukawa trees."},{"kind":"audio","t":103288.806323,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103290.339205,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103291.93409699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":103293.53382,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103295.209624,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103296.97456,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":970},{"kind":"audio","t":103297.08534199999,"samples":4992,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":114017.598641,"text":"Zu den beliebten Sportarten gehören Fußball, Basketball, Volleyball, Wasserball, Fechten, Rugby, Radfahren, Eishockey, Rollhockey und Formel 1 Motorsport."},{"kind":"text","t":114464.450834,"text":"Popular sports include football, basketball, volleyball, water polo, fencing, rugby, cycling, ice hockey, roller hockey, and Formula 1 racing."},{"kind":"audio","t":114513.107744,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114514.751188,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114516.381301,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114517.983344,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114519.601387,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114521.219339,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114522.87951299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114524.43487499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":670},{"kind":"audio","t":114524.58052799999,"samples":56,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":121547.16526,"text":"Im warmen Klima des Mittleren Ostens kamen Häusern keine so große Bedeutung zu."},{"kind":"text","t":121817.114693,"text":"In the warm climate of the Middle East, houses did not hold such great significance."},{"kind":"audio","t":121858.012806,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121859.634759,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"audio","t":121861.31993299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121862.932826,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121863.313564,"samples":14128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":20},{"kind":"input","t":130781.27962900001,"text":"Der Archipel liegt 120 km nördlich der Halbinsel. Die größte ist King George Island mit der Siedlung Villa Las Estrellas."},{"kind":"text","t":131096.667617,"text":"The archipelago is located 120 km north of the peninsula. The largest is King George Island, with the settlement of Villa Las Estrellas."},{"kind":"audio","t":131138.705232,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131140.656292,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131142.34375600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131144.071071,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":131144.50813,"samples":8728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":131182.772219,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131184.076065,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":131185.708518,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131187.378792,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":131187.529615,"samples":8728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":137565.955829,"text":"Der Kohlsaft ändert seine Farbe, je nachdem wie sauer oder basisch alkalisch die Chemikalie ist."},{"kind":"text","t":137889.84383,"text":"The color of the cabbage juice changes depending on whether the chemical is acidic or basic/alkaline."},{"kind":"audio","t":137933.18280200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137934.882927,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137936.486989,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137938.050101,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137939.664934,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":137939.91198900001,"samples":12560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":142714.992096,"text":"Die Brücke soll im September 2017 vollständig den Betrieb aufnehmen."},{"kind":"text","t":142971.03278600003,"text":"The bridge is scheduled to begin full operation in September 2017."},{"kind":"audio","t":143013.928839,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143015.321247,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143016.88927900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143018.516532,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":143018.84489900002,"samples":12328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":147826.786664,"text":"Es wird erwartet, dass die brasilianischen Zollpunkte dann fertiggestellt sein werden."},{"kind":"text","t":148053.17944100001,"text":"It is expected that the Brazilian customs checkpoints will be completed by then."},{"kind":"audio","t":148093.33894800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148094.99189200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148096.67741600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148098.24785800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"audio","t":148098.39824100002,"samples":928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":158085.80264,"text":"Die Feuchtigkeit auf ihren Händen reagiert mit den äußeren Schichten, was sich komisch anfühlt und eine Art Schutzschicht bildet."},{"kind":"text","t":158421.523251,"text":"The moisture on their hands reacts with the outer layers, which feels strange and forms a kind of protective layer."},{"kind":"audio","t":158467.719153,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158469.132751,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158470.66683200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158472.325975,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158473.957308,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158474.929697,"samples":23960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":163928.558808,"text":"Eine Bombe explodierte vor dem Bürogebäude des Generalgouverneurs."},{"kind":"text","t":164139.98424800002,"text":"A bomb exploded in front of the governor-general’s office building."},{"kind":"audio","t":164179.46429600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164181.105019,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164182.71689100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":164183.278962,"samples":16296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":173014.21475100002,"text":"Der marokkanische Sultan baute die Stadt als Daelbeda wieder auf und sie wurde von spanischen Händlern, die dort Handelsstützpunkte einrichteten, Casablanca genannt."},{"kind":"text","t":173459.421097,"text":"The Moroccan sultan rebuilt the city as Daelbeda, and it was named Casablanca by Spanish traders who established trading posts there."},{"kind":"audio","t":173507.979656,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":173509.307922,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":173510.95988600003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":173512.63192900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":173514.262481,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":173515.91861400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":173517.359973,"samples":31392,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":630},{"kind":"input","t":180638.898938,"text":"Er wurde von Wong Kang-Seng, dem stellvertretenden Premierminister Singapurs, begrüßt."},{"kind":"text","t":180879.936229,"text":"He was greeted by Wong Kang-Seng, Singapore’s Deputy Prime Minister."},{"kind":"audio","t":180920.955598,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":180922.51401900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":180924.14657100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":180925.360946,"samples":27696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":187155.37586600002,"text":"und sprach mit Lee Hsing-Long, dem Premierminister Singapurs, über Handels- und Terrorismusangelegenheiten."},{"kind":"text","t":187450.87162400002,"text":"And he discussed trade and terrorism issues with Lee Hsing-Long, Singapore’s Prime Minister."},{"kind":"audio","t":187494.869802,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187496.26581,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187497.866932,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":187499.449384,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":340,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":187500.58809600002,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":510},{"kind":"input","t":200635.213828,"text":"Die Atombombe basiert auf dem Prinzip, dass man Energie benötigt."},{"kind":"text","t":200848.18129900002,"text":"The atomic bomb is based on the principle that energy is required."},{"kind":"audio","t":200887.878241,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200889.49153300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200891.170797,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200892.082035,"samples":23496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":400},{"kind":"input","t":201208.11995300002,"text":"um einen Kern mit vielen Protonen und Neutronen zusammenzusetzen."},{"kind":"text","t":201406.705477,"text":"to form a nucleus with many protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"audio","t":201446.478451,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":201447.973231,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":201449.548252,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":880},{"kind":"audio","t":201449.675515,"samples":1896,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":207316.07164500002,"text":"Für die Archipelä und Seen brauchen Sie nicht unbedingt eine Yacht."},{"kind":"text","t":207557.23235900002,"text":"You don’t necessarily need a yacht for the archipelagos and lakes."},{"kind":"audio","t":207596.84607,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":207598.490262,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":207600.17999600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":207600.433821,"samples":11496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":217805.33253800002,"code":1005}]}